{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415036","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415036","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041503601:1":{"text":"ヤッホー！偉大なるババリアの戦神、お会いできて光栄よ！","source_cn":"呀呼！非常荣幸见到您，伟大的蛮血战神！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF35302787E1945D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041503602:1":{"text":"いまだ無敗の無敵の戦士、ブルータスさん！","source_cn":"我们百战百胜，所向披靡的——布鲁特斯大人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72D2F895605B3E1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041503603:1":{"text":"……ケホッ、ケホッ、少し落ち着け、マンカラ。","source_cn":"……咳咳，冷静点，曼卡拉。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB0870772672574F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041503604:1":{"text":"今は戦歌祭ではないし、ここは砂漠でもない。大声を上げてたら白い目で見られるだけだ。","source_cn":"现在不是战歌节，这里也不是沙漠，大喊大叫只会让人侧目。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x656D0E9976D03F53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041503605:1":{"text":"それに、このリラックスした雰囲気の中、戦神とか叫ぶのもやめろ。","source_cn":"而且，这种放松的环境，就不用再叫什么战神了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18B194FA9A958D0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041503606:1":{"text":"りょーかい！ほんとに控えめなんだから！","source_cn":"明——白！您真是个低调的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C1AFC49D3030E6C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041503607:1":{"text":"じゃあ、これからのインタビューでは、なんて呼べばいいの？\nスーパーライオン？ライオンキング？剣聖・ブルータス？","source_cn":"那之后的采访里，您喜欢什么样的称呼？\\n超级狮子？夺命...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08D5BFEFEA952BE4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041503608:1":{"text":"……今のまま戦神でいい。","source_cn":"……你还是叫我战神吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x243E2DBFDCCFC007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"マンカラ","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"ブルータス","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}